            '2. Calling too much (folding is often correct)',
            '3. Ignoring position',
            '4. Not adjusting to opponents',
            '5. Poor bankroll management',
            '6. Going on tilt',
            '7. Over-valuing one-pair hands',
            "8. Not considering opponent's range",
